Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我们这些人里  你们认为下一个结婚的会是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, out of all of us, who do you think will get married next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是摩妮卡和钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Probably Monica and Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  能卖我一包纽宝牌淡烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, could I have a pack of Newport Lights? please?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有卖烟  不过街对面的报摊上有卖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, urn, uh, we don't sell cigarettes, but they have them at the newsstand across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'd be great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅莉莎沃伯顿  我可没什么精神准备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Melissa Worbert. I don't think I have the energy for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  瑞瑞葛林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Ray-Ray Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅莉莎  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Melissa. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们过去的7次女生联谊会  你都像失踪了一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've been M.I.A for the past seven sorority newsletters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到那边去说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't I tell you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最后一次听说你   是说你要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So last I heard you were gonna get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的瑞瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Poor Ray-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  这很好  我其实一切都挺好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no. it's-It's good. It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在替罗夫罗兰工作  别说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I actually work at Ralph Lauren. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不呢  我是运动男装部的主管\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will not. Heh, heh. I'm the divisional head of men's sportswear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  别再说了  你跟罗夫是朋友吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, shut up more! Now, are you friends with Ralph?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, please. Ha. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要一起吃个饭  你明天晚上做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, we have to have dinner. What are you doing tomorrow night?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.06,0:01:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天  我不知道  现在你知道了  你要和我吃晚饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, tomorrow. I don't know. Um--You do now. You're having dinner with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了  看到你真好  瑞瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've gotta go. This has been so great, Ray-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给我  这是我的名片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, so listen, just call me. Here's my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做房地产  不  那是旧名片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're in real estate? Oh, no, heh, that's an old card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想离开这个行业去做些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I wanted to get out of that and-and do something where I can really...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以帮助别人和改变世界的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...help people and make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. What do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宴会规划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a party planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天见  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll see you tomorrow. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.47,0:01:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  伙计们  看谁回来了  是瑞瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey guys, look who's back. It's Ray-Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  那是我大学的朋友梅莉莎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up that was my friend, Melissa, from college.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来非常非常好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She seems really, really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的很甜  我们曾经很亲密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's actually very sweet, and we used to be very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  她不是那个和你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. she isn't...She's not the one who you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和你什么  和你什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who you what? Who you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  喔什么  喔什么  和你什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow-Wow, what? Wow what?! Who you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们曾经是情人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They were lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不是情人  那又没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we weren't. It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大四的时候  有一天晚上  我们去参加舞会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was one night, senior year, and we went to a party...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝了很多桑格利亚调酒  你知道  最后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...had a lot of sangria, and you know, ended up...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们接吻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...kissing for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有两任老婆是同性恋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that's two of my wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第20集  同性之吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E20  The One With Rachel's Big Kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.99,0:02:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  乐队在这儿  酒吧在这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so this is where the band is. And this is where the bar is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些大头针上都有人名  瑞秋  你在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And all these pins have people's names on them. And Rach, here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不给我一杯曼哈顿  把我挪到这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't we just take me and put me with a Manhattan in my hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和可爱的男酒保聊天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...talking to the cute bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些大头针不是用来玩的  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These pins aren't for playing, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红的是我的客人  蓝色的是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, the red ones are my guests, and the blue ones are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.43,0:03:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可怜  我只有10个客人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is so sad. I mean, I only have like 10 pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  轻松一点  这又不是比赛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, Chandler, relax. It's not a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是实力相当的比赛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Certainly not a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再想了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop picturing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想就这样吧  座位都确定了  这就是我们的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think that's it. The seating chart is done. This is our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们看上去都很开心  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. They all look like they're having fun  don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸妈坐哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so where are my parents gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看啊  如果这是婚礼大厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's see, well, if this is the wedding hall, then, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父母会在皇后区的家里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your parents would be over here at home in Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他们没有被邀请  哦不  这太可怕了  他们会发疯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What they're not invited? Oh, no, that's terrible! they're gonna be crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们觉得会被邀请\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would they think they're invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你问倒我了  我不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got me. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   抱歉  我以为父母都会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! Well, I'm sorry. Look, I thought parents were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的父母会来  钱德的父母也会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know? Your parents are coming. Chandler's parents are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯的父母也会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross's parents are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯的父母就是我的父母\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross's parents are my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看么  父母们都会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well-well, see, parents are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们应该邀请他们  算了吧  你就想多增加几根蓝色大头针\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I think we should invite them. Oh please, you just want more blue pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这实在太悲惨了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  也许我重新安排一下位置可以让他们进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. all right. Maybe I can fit them in if I just do some rearranging.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  瑞秋可能真的要坐在吧台了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But uh, Rachel may actually have to sit at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你可以叫杯桑格利亚调酒  去你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you'll order a little sangria. Oh, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有的晚礼服都在这儿  随便你喜欢哪一件  都可以便宜给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now, these are all the tuxedos that we make and if there's anything that you like, we can make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任选一件  但这三件是摩妮卡先核准的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anything at all. But these are the three that Monica pre-approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我挑晚礼服  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, thanks a lot for hooking me up Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你作为我的客人出席婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I want you to know that I want you to attend our wedding as my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是摩妮卡的伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Monica's maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  别想把我钉在你的蓝色大头针上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, don't try to blue-pin me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:06:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那这些呢  怎么样  看起来不错  是不错啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what's the deal with these? These-these look nice. Oh they are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是帮名人量身打造的  他们穿过后就送回来这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We-we custom-make tuxedos for celebrities and then when they're done with them they just send 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指像颁奖典礼之后  有些是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean, like, for award shows? Some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都上过红地毯  被人叫着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean these tuxes have been down the red carpet with people yelling, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你是穿谁的  你看来棒极了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}..."Who are you wearing? You look fabulous!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我建议你  多看一点ESPN体育频道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, might I suggest watching a little more ESPN...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少看一点八卦娱乐节目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and a little less E!.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁穿过这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Who wore those?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是汤姆布罗考(NBC新闻主播)穿过的  不错嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, well, let's see uh, this one's Tom Brokaw. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是保罗奥尼尔(美财政部长)穿过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This one is, uh, Paul O'Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是"洋基队"的球员  真的  多看看ESPN\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He plays for the Yankees. Seriously, ESPN.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算有的时候  开着频道当背景听也好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just once in a while. Have it on in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件是皮尔斯布鲁斯南穿过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, this one was Pierce Brosnan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮尔斯布鲁斯南  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pierce Brosnan? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  真的啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,007\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}O07?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是詹姆斯邦德的晚礼服  我一定要穿詹姆斯邦德的晚礼服结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is James Bond's tux? Oh, I have to get married in James Bond's tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:06:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是很酷的礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. It's a pretty cool tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只如此  我会是英格兰最强大的武器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, Oh, it's not just that. I would be England's most powerful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女王陛下的秘密特务  环游世界的负心人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A jet-setting heartbreaker on Her Majesty's secret service.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有杀人执照  什么都不怕的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A man who fears no one, with a license to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡会不会让我穿这件呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would Monica let me wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该学真正的玩法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should really learn how to play the real way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢我们的玩法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走的好  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice move. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我替罗斯和钱德挑选好了婚礼上用的晚礼服  你需要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Joey I just hooked Ross and Chandler up with some tuxedos for the wedding, Do you need one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我主持婚礼  我不穿晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm performing the ceremony. I'm not wearing a tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你打算穿什么  五彩长袍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what are you gonna wear? Multi-colored robes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许戴一顶帽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, and maybe a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡知道吗  我想她不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. Does Monica know about this? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她时我能在场吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I please be there when you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋等等  今晚要不要去看电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach wait! you want to go to a movie tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没办法  我去不了  我要和梅莉莎吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know what? I can't. I have to have dinner with that Melissa girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能跟你去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会出声  你只会听见我摄影机的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won't even talk! You'll just hear the noise from my video camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  怎么回事  让我来告诉她吗  能让我来告诉她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What's going on? Oh good! Can I tell her? Can I tell her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.31,0:08:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要听真实发生的事  还是听乔伊的下流版本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want to hear what actually happened or Joey's lewd version?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊的  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  少来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大学时我有一个朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had this friend from college...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我犯了一个愚蠢的错误  我告诉乔伊有一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I made the mistake of telling Joey that one time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她和我接吻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she and I, you know, kissed a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  我相信这当然发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm sure that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It did. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  那就真的发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, heh. It happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是大四那年  有一次开夏威夷主题派对舞会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it was senior year in college. It was after the Sigma Chi luau...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和梅莉莎喝得大醉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and Melissa and I got very drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我们两个接吻了  足足有好几分钟呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we ended up kissing. For several minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是在脸颊上轻轻地亲了一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which means she had a couple spritzers and a peck on the cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要剥夺我的幻想呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you taking this away from me? Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你就不相信呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, why is it so hard for you to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我不知道你是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I just I didn't know that you were a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说我是同性恋  我只是说那件事发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not saying that I'm a lesbian. I'm just saying that this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得很狂野  而你是这么地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, it just seems pretty wild. And you're-You know, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...vanilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖宝宝  我不是乖宝宝  我会做很多疯狂的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vanilla? I'm not vanilla. I've done lots of crazy things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还喝醉了  在拉斯维加斯还结了婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I got drunk and married in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  如果你还不相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, y'know what? If you don't want to believe me  about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚和我一起去吃饭  她会告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...why don't you just come with me to dinner tonight and she'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  反正我也想像不出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. All right! Yeah! Because I can't picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该到我脑子里来看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-ho, you should get inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜我为你的婚礼弄到什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess what I got for your wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个脑袋上有衣架的畸形女友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A freakishly thin date with a hanger for a head?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  瑞秋帮我找一件晚礼服  可不是随随便便的一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Rachel hooked me up with a tux. But not just any tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是蝙蝠侠的晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Batman's tux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件晚礼服是给瓦尔基尔默在电影中用的  让他穿在票房冠军电影里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Made expressly for Val Kilmer, and worn by him in the hit film...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他演的那部蝙蝠侠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that Batman film he was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能穿那件  我穿了名人的晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't wear that. I'm wearing the famous tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆士庞德的晚礼服    那又怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}James Bond's tux. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样  如果你穿那件  会让我显得不那么特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So—If you wear that, you'll make mine less special.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要什么来让那天特别一点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you need something to to make this day special?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你有了最特别的一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello! You have the most special thing of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你娶了你最爱的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are marrying the woman you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  不要抢走我的锋头嘛  拜托拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, don't take away my cool thing. Please?! Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"拜托拜托"   这可不象007\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Pretty please?" Not very, uh, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的婚礼  如果是你结婚  我不会做任何让你生气的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, it's my wedding day okay? If you were getting married, I'd never do anything to upset you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我结婚的时候  你和我妹妹上床  那就很007\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I got married you slept with my sister. That was pretty 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  好  你来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey. Okay, good. You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我想出办法来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这两桌的8个人  加上你父母\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna take 2 tables of 8, I'm gonna add your parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成3桌6个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I'm gonna turn them into 3 tables of 6. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经通知了办酒席的人  要多做两份  都弄好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I called the caterer. I added two extra meals, We are good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  不过他们不来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. They're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为什么  他们觉得你是因为我才邀请他们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somehow they got the idea that you only invited them because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有点觉得自己是多余的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They...feel a little unwanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕  确实那样的  不过还是很糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh that's too bad. It's true. But too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不这样摩妮卡  你可以打电话给我妈  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Mon, if you could just call my mom. Oh, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  让她知道是你真心希望他们去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. Look just-just tell—let her know that you really want them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  这可是每年都给你送很多很多千层面的女人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's not forget this is a woman who that has sent you many lasagnas over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  她哪有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, she hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些没送到你手里也不是她的错啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it her fault that some of them didn't make it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我该怎么说呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what am I gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她请帖搞乱了  不  怪邮局好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just uh, Just tell them you mixed up invitations. No, no, no, blame it on the post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们最恨邮局  还有爱尔兰人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They hate the post office. And the Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想你不能怪到他们头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I don't think you could blame it on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:12:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你好  崔比亚尼太太吗  我是摩妮卡盖勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Yeah, hi. Uh, Mrs. Tribbiani? Hi, this is Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你  钱德跟我希望你们能来参加婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just calling to say that Chandler and I uh, really hope you can make the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很多请帖都没寄到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, apparently a bunch of invitations that we sent weren't delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜又是可恶的邮局搞砸的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I guess there was some screw-up at the damn post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么美国邮局  更像是美国遗失局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, the U.S. Post Office? No. More like U.S. Lost Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道他们都是爱尔兰人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are they, Irish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之呢  他叫艾伦  我们在一起三年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, his name's Allen. And we've been going out for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我做宴会规划的第一位客户\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was my first client when I became a party planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时他正要为他当时的女朋友  规划一场宴会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was actually planning a party for his girlfriend at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果就变成这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是雪城大学兄弟会的  哦  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. He was Theta Beta Pi at Syracuse. Oh! Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你参加过女生联谊会吗  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, were you ever in a sorority? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:13:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是大腿卫生棉条的成员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. I was a, um, Thigh Mega Tampon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们规模也很大  但后来他们把我们解散了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Y'know, we were really huge too. But then they had to shut us down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为瑞吉娜佛兰姬基死于酒精中毒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when Regina Phalangie died of alcohol poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是糟糕   一颗老鼠屎就毁了一锅粥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, isn't it a shame when one girl ruins it for the whole bunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醉话说的太多了   我告诉菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Speaking of drinking too much, I was, uh, telling Phoebe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐妹会开夏威夷派对  很疯的那晚  我们亲吻的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about that one crazy night after the Sigma Chi luau where you and I uh, we made out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得嘛  我们穿着土著裙子  还有椰子壳比基尼上衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember we-Come on, we had sarongs on and we had coconut bikini tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后我们回到家  继续在那儿疯癫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We went back to the house and got really silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们接吻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we made out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞瑞  我不知道你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, Ray-Ray, I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯是蝙蝠侠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross is Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还真会掩护秘密身分  瞒了这么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he did manage to keep his identity secret for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋替罗斯弄到  瓦尔基尔默在蝙蝠侠里穿的晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel got Ross the tuxedo that Val Kilmer wore in Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠侠可比詹姆士庞德酷多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Batman is so much cooler than James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊  007有好多新式武器   蝙蝠侠有多功能腰带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?!  007 has all those gadgets. Batman has a utility belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,007有特制的汽车   蝙蝠侠有蝙蝠车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}007 has a fancy car. Batman has the Batmobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,007有美女相伴  蝙蝠侠只有罗宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}007 gets all the ladies. Heh. Batman has Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有ESPN台  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We get ESPN, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如你去穿上007晚礼服   我来给你调一杯马丁尼酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about you go put on your 007 tuxedo, and I'll make you a nice martini?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢  马丁尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually I don't like martinis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那有搞笑吸管的摇摇饮料呢  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A Yoo-Hoo with a funny straw? Ooh, yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请帖上写晚上6点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I know the invitation says 6:00...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:15:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是指6点入席  还是6点开始表演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but does that mean that you want people to get there at 6, or the show is gonna start right at 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The show?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  婚礼  知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, Right. the wedding. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过婚礼能不能晚一点开始  我是说  婚礼晚一点进行  行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I mean, it's gonna start a little late right? I mean, weddings start late. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有参加过我规划的婚礼吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you ever been to one of my weddings?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  事情是这样的  那天也是我外甥女的洗礼日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, Well look, the thing is it's the same day as my niece's christening...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的希望我父母能准时出席来看我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I really want my parents to be there in time to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的角色是在开始部分  演出的其他部分没我什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause My part's just in the beginning. I'm not even in the rest of the show-Wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼6点开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The wedding starts at 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好  我完全明白了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay, I totally hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样如何  我可以表演个小节目到他们来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh! How about this? I vamp a little till they get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要 "表演"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. You'll "vamp"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  就像给观众热热身  问问他们从哪儿来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, y'know, like warm up the crowd. Ask 'em where they're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为有乔伊崔比亚尼在  就像同时拥有了一个牧师和一个演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause In Joey Tribbiani, you get a minister and you get an entertainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是一位 "表演牧师"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a "mini-stainer."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会比这更好的了  不会比这更棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no one better. There's no one greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会不记得我们接吻的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you not remember us kissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  很多从没发生过的事我不记得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I don't remember a lot of things that never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  记得我们在卧室外的走廊  一直笑一直笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! Remember, we were on the sleeping porch? We couldn't stop giggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们戴的椰子壳都撞在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And our coconuts kept knocking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  乔伊的脑袋该爆炸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, somewhere Joey's head is exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  听着  抱歉  我不是想让你难堪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah—but come on—Listen, I'm sorry I don't want to make you uncomfortable...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我告诉菲比那件事  她不相信我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I told Phoebe it happened, and she doesn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  瑞瑞  如果我认为真有那回事  我会承认的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Ray-ray. I mean, if I thought it happened, I would say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我醉睡过去后  你亲了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I passed out and you did stuff to me while I was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  没关系的  不必这样  我相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, It's okay, you don't have to do this. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你说你吻过梅莉莎  你就是吻过梅莉莎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, if-if you say you kissed Melissa, then you kissed Melissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  菲比  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Phoebe. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是她没有  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But she didn't. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到哪儿都带着它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just carry that around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现这可以成为我炫耀的资本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I find it to be something of a conversation piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和  阿甘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Between you and...? Gunther.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么不一起穿上呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey. Why don't we put them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍一张蝙蝠侠和詹姆士庞德一起的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know get a picture of Batman and James Bond, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意  但是我的不合身  裤子小了一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would but mine doesn't fit. The pants a little tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小了一点  我可以看到里面的两个0和一个7\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little tight? I could see double-oh and seven in those pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕  我还很期待  穿着我们的名人晚礼服一起亮相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well that stinks. I was looking forward to us wearing our celebrity tuxes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你意思是你不打算穿你的了  你开玩笑吗  这可是蝙蝠侠的晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, does that mean that you're not gonna be wearing yours? What are you kidding? It's Batman's tux!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿上试试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不过只能试穿上衣  两个O和一个7就不要穿进去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. But just the jacket. double-oh and seven are not getting in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双面通风的舒适型   蝙蝠侠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Holy double-vented comfort, Batman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's this? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《真情难舍》首映的请柬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An invitation to the At First Sight premiere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦尔基尔默没有在蝙蝠侠里面穿这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Val Kilmer didn't wear this in Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他穿这个  演瞎子的那部文艺爱情片首映\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He wore it to the premiere of some tooty-fruity lovestory where he was a blind guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你唯一的超能力  就是嗅觉发达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only super power you have is the slightly heightened sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  钱德  可以和你们谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Uh, Monica? Chandler? can I talk to you guys for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  我放弃了  你想怎样就怎样吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right that's it, I give up. Whatever you want, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要唱歌还是跳舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to sing a song? You wanna do a dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让你妈妈站在圣坛前大喊种族危机  我都不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want your mom stand at the altar screaming racial slurs? I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要谢谢你们  为我父母做的一切  他们很高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No, I-I just want to thank you guys for what you did for my parents. that was really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能参与你们最特别的一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're so happy to get to be a part of your special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气  告诉他们  我们很高兴他们会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, your welcome. And tell them we're really glad they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的  给你们看  我婚礼要穿的衣服  是他们替我准备的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I will. Oh, check out what they got me to wear for the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我替你们证婚时这样戴  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? I wear it like this when I marry you guys. And then this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在宴会时这样戴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is for party time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是真的  我告诉你那发生过  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It happened. I am telling you it happened. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Well, it was great meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:19:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  瑞秋  我想我不会给你打电话了  因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, Rachel? I don't think I'll be calling you because, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你变得好奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, you've gotten weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保重  两位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take care, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  等等  等一下  好  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wha-Wait a minute. No wait a minute! Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天晚上的事是  我这辈子里干的最疯狂的一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That night was the one wild thing I've ever done in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你这样轻易就否认\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm not gonna let you take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不记得那件事  也许你会记得这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so if you don't remember that, maybe you'll remember this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  你爱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我当然记得我们的吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Of course I remember our kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每时每刻都在想着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还能听到  椰子壳碰在一起的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can still hear the coconuts knocking together, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想告诉你  因为我不觉得  你会回报我的爱  现在你回报\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just didn't want to tell you, because I didn't think that you'd return my love. and now that you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  喔  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看谁突然害羞起来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw! Look who's being suddenly shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定和我有一样的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't tell me you don't feel what I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是要发自于内心  才能吻得那么好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody can kiss that good and not mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是吻功很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I-I-I-I'm just…I'm just a good kisser!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you don't have to be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm obviously kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没爱上你  我也没爱上她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not in love with you. I'm not in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.21,0:20:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没听到椰子壳撞在一起的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't hear coconuts banging together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和男友做爱时没幻想你的脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I don't picture your face when I make love to my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吻别一下吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A kiss goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到会是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I had no idea that that was gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想看看这有什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to see what all the fuss was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢  我尝试过更好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And? I've had better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我找到一件合身的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right! I found one that fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  人们常说  第23次就会成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know what they say? 23rd time's a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  好英俊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw! Look at you, all handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁穿过这件  有关系吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whose is it? Oh, does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一重要的是你看来很英俊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All that matters is that you look so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁的  我不想讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whose is it? I don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我不在乎  是谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on, I don't care. Come on! Whose is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黛安基顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Diane Keaton.
